#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:2
msgid "Snapshots"
msgstr "Snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:5
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:7
msgid ""
"Snapshots capture the state of a virtual machine's disk(s) at a specific "
"point in time, allowing administrators to quickly revert a VM to a previous "
"state if needed. |morpheus| provides centralized snapshot management across "
"clouds, supporting creation, reversion, and deletion of snapshots."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots capture el estado de un virtual machine's disco(s) en un "
"específico punto en tiempo, allowing administrators a quickly revert un VM a"
" un anterior estado si es necesario. |morpheus| proporciona centralized "
"snapshot gestión a través de clouds, supporting creation, reversion, y "
"deletion de snapshots."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:9
msgid ""
"Snapshots can be managed from the server/instance detail page or from a "
"centralized snapshots view."
msgstr ""
"Snapshots se puede gestionar desde el servidor/instance página de detalles o"
" desde un centralized snapshots ver."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:12
msgid "Role Requirements"
msgstr "Role Requirements"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:14
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure: Compute`` role permission at **Full** level is required to"
" create, revert, or delete snapshots."
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure: Compute`` permiso de rol en **Full** nivel es requerido a "
"crear, revert, o eliminar snapshots."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:15
msgid "**Read** access allows viewing existing snapshots."
msgstr "**Read** acceso permite viewing existente snapshots."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:18
msgid "Viewing Snapshots"
msgstr "Viewing Snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:20
msgid "From a Server:"
msgstr "Desde un Servidor:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:22
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:87
msgid "Navigate to the server detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el server detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:23
msgid "Select the **SNAPSHOTS** tab"
msgstr "Seleccionar el **SNAPSHOTS** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:25
msgid "The Snapshots tab displays all snapshots for the server, including:"
msgstr ""
"El Snapshots pestaña muestra todos snapshots para el servidor, incluyendo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:27
msgid "**Name** — Snapshot name or description"
msgstr "**Name** — Snapshot nombre o descripción"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:28
msgid "**Date Created** — When the snapshot was taken"
msgstr "**Date Creado** — Cuando el snapshot fue taken"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:29
msgid "**Size** — Disk space consumed by the snapshot"
msgstr "**Size** — Disco space consumed por el snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:30
msgid "**Status** — Snapshot state (active, creating, deleting)"
msgstr "**Status** — Snapshot estado (activo, creating, deleting)"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:33
msgid "Creating a Snapshot"
msgstr "Creating un Snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:35
msgid "Navigate to the server or instance detail page"
msgstr "Navegue un el server o instance detail página"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:36
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:88
msgid "Click :guilabel:`ACTIONS`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`ACCIONES`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:37
msgid "Select **Snapshot**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **Snapshot**"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:38
msgid "In the snapshot dialog, configure:"
msgstr "En el snapshot dialog, configure:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:40
msgid "NAME"
msgstr "NAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:41
msgid "A descriptive name for the snapshot."
msgstr "Un descriptive nombre para el snapshot."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:42
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:43
msgid "Optional notes about the snapshot's purpose or what state it captures."
msgstr ""
"Opcional notes acerca de el snapshot's purpose o qué estado it captures."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:44
msgid "MEMORY"
msgstr "MEMORY"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:45
msgid ""
"(Where supported) Include the VM's memory state in the snapshot. This allows"
" reverting to the exact running state."
msgstr ""
"(Donde soportado) Incluir el VM's memoria estado en el snapshot. Este "
"permite reverting al exact ejecutando estado."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:47
msgid "QUIESCE"
msgstr "QUIESCE"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:47
msgid ""
"(Where supported) Quiesce the guest file system before taking the snapshot. "
"This ensures application-consistent data."
msgstr ""
"(Donde soportado) Quiesce el guest sistema de archivos antes de taking el "
"snapshot. Este ensures aplicación-consistent datos."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:49
msgid "Click :guilabel:`CREATE`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`CREATE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:51
msgid ""
"The snapshot operation runs asynchronously. The new snapshot will appear in "
"the Snapshots tab once complete."
msgstr ""
"El snapshot operación ejecuta asynchronously. El nuevo snapshot será "
"aparecer en el Snapshots pestaña una vez completado."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:54
msgid "Reverting to a Snapshot"
msgstr "Reverting a un Snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:56
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:65
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:76
msgid "Navigate to the server's **SNAPSHOTS** tab"
msgstr "Navegue un el server's **SNAPSHOTS** pestaña"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:57
msgid "Click the revert icon next to the desired snapshot"
msgstr "Click el revert ícono siguiente al desired snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:58
msgid "Confirm the revert operation"
msgstr "Confirmar el revert operación"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:60
msgid ""
"Reverting to a snapshot discards all changes made since the snapshot was "
"taken. This includes disk writes, configuration changes, and (if memory was "
"not captured) the running state of applications."
msgstr ""
"Reverting a un snapshot discards todos cambios made desde el snapshot fue "
"taken. Este incluye disco writes, configuración cambios, y (si memoria fue "
"no captured) el ejecutando estado de aplicaciones."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:63
msgid "Deleting a Snapshot"
msgstr "Deleting un Snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:66
msgid "Click the delete icon next to the snapshot"
msgstr "Click el eliminar ícono siguiente al snapshot"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:67
#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:78
msgid "Confirm the deletion"
msgstr "Confirmar el deletion"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:69
msgid ""
"Deleting a snapshot consolidates the snapshot data back into the base disk. "
"This frees the space consumed by the snapshot delta."
msgstr ""
"Deleting un snapshot consolidates el snapshot datos back en el base disco. "
"Este frees el space consumed por el snapshot delta."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:72
msgid "Deleting All Snapshots"
msgstr "Deleting Todos Snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:74
msgid "To remove all snapshots for a server:"
msgstr "Para eliminar todos snapshots para un server:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:77
msgid "Click :guilabel:`DELETE ALL`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`DELETE ALL`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:80
msgid ""
"Deleting all snapshots consolidates the entire snapshot chain. This "
"operation may take time for VMs with large or numerous snapshots."
msgstr ""
"Deleting todos snapshots consolidates el entire snapshot chain. Este "
"operación puede tomar tiempo para VMs con grande o numerous snapshots."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:83
msgid "Importing Snapshots"
msgstr "Importing Snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:85
msgid "|morpheus| can import existing snapshots from the hypervisor:"
msgstr "|morpheus| puede import existente snapshots desde el hypervisor:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:89
msgid "Select **Import Snapshot**"
msgstr "Seleccionar **Import Snapshot**"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:90
msgid "Select the snapshot to import from the hypervisor"
msgstr "Seleccionar el snapshot a import desde el hypervisor"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:91
msgid "Click :guilabel:`IMPORT`"
msgstr "Click :guilabel:`IMPORT`"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:94
msgid "Snapshot Best Practices"
msgstr "Snapshot Best Practices"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:96
msgid ""
"**Keep snapshots short-lived** — Snapshots consume increasing disk space "
"over time as the delta grows. Delete snapshots once they are no longer "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"**Keep snapshots short-lived** — Snapshots consume increasing disco space "
"sobre tiempo como el delta grows. Eliminar snapshots once they son no longer"
" necesario."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Don't use as backups** — Snapshots are not a replacement for proper "
"backups. They reside on the same storage as the VM and are lost if the "
"storage fails."
msgstr ""
"**Don't use as backups** — Snapshots son no un replacement para proper "
"backups. They reside en el mismo storage como el VM y son lost si el storage"
" falla."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Limit chain depth** — Avoid creating deep chains of snapshots (snapshot of"
" a snapshot). Performance degrades with chain depth."
msgstr ""
"**Limit chain depth** — Avoid creating deep chains de snapshots (snapshot de"
" un snapshot). Rendimiento degrades con chain profundidad."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Quiesce when possible** — For application consistency, always quiesce the "
"guest file system before snapshotting databases or transactional workloads."
msgstr ""
"**Quiesce when possible** — Para aplicación consistency, siempre quiesce el "
"guest sistema de archivos antes de snapshotting bases de datos o "
"transactional cargas de trabajo."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:100
msgid ""
"**Archive snapshots** — Configure the default archive store "
"(``Administration > Settings > Appliance > Archive Store``) if snapshots "
"need to be stored externally."
msgstr ""
"**Archive snapshots** — Configure el predeterminado archive store "
"(``Administration > Settings > Appliance > Archive Store``) si snapshots "
"necesita a be stored externally."

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:103
msgid "Supported Cloud Types"
msgstr "Soportado Nube Tipos"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:105
msgid "Snapshot support varies by cloud type:"
msgstr "Snapshot support varies por cloud tipo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:107
msgid ""
"**VMware vSphere** — Full support including memory snapshots and quiescing"
msgstr ""
"**VMware vSphere** — Completo support incluyendo memoria snapshots y "
"quiescing"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:108
msgid "**Nutanix AHV** — Snapshot support without memory state"
msgstr "**Nutanix AHV** — Snapshot support sin memoria estado"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:109
msgid "**KVM/MVM** — Snapshot support via libvirt/qemu snapshots"
msgstr "**KVM/MVM** — Snapshot support via libvirt/qemu snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:110
msgid "**Azure** — Managed disk snapshots"
msgstr "**Azure** — Administrado disco snapshots"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:111
msgid "**AWS** — EBS snapshots (volume-level)"
msgstr "**AWS** — EBS snapshots (volumen-nivel)"

#: ../../infrastructure/storage/snapshots.rst:113
msgid ""
"Some cloud types may not support all snapshot options (e.g., memory "
"snapshots, quiescing). Unavailable options will be hidden or greyed out in "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"Algunos cloud tipos puede no support todos snapshot opciones (e.g., memoria "
"snapshots, quiescing). Unavailable opciones será be hidden o greyed out en "
"el dialog."
